{"attributes":{"description":"Pre-built triage board for the three seeded intrusions.","kibanaSavedObjectMeta":{"searchSourceJSON":"{\"query\":{\"query\":\"\",\"language\":\"kuery\"},\"filter\":[]}"},"optionsJSON":"{\"useMargins\":true,\"hidePanelTitles\":false}","panelsJSON":"[{\"gridData\":{\"y\":0,\"w\":48,\"h\":7,\"i\":\"md\",\"x\":0},\"panelIndex\":\"md\",\"version\":\"8.14.3\",\"type\":\"visualization\",\"embeddableConfig\":{\"savedVis\":{\"title\":\"\",\"params\":{\"markdown\":\"## AFTERMATH - Triage\\n\\n**Three intrusions are staged in this SIEM. Set the time picker to `Last 7 days` - events are backdated.**\\n\\n- **S01 (Windows, WKSTN-01)** - phishing -\\u003e PowerShell -\\u003e Run-key persistence (Sysmon + PowerShell).\\n- **S02 (Linux, wkstn-lnx)** - SSH brute force -\\u003e foothold -\\u003e sudo -\\u003e C2 (auth.log + Suricata).\\n- **S03 (Web, DVWA)** - scan -\\u003e SQLi / command injection, blocked by the WAF (lab-edge-modsecurity).\\n\\nEach panel is a saved search. Tickets: `SCENARIOS.md` - answers: `SOLUTIONS.md`.\",\"openLinksInNewTab\":true,\"fontSize\":12},\"uiState\":{},\"data\":{\"aggs\":[],\"searchSource\":{\"query\":{\"query\":\"\",\"language\":\"kuery\"},\"filter\":[]}},\"type\":\"markdown\"}}},{\"version\":\"8.14.3\",\"gridData\":{\"y\":7,\"w\":48,\"h\":13,\"i\":\"p1\",\"x\":0},\"panelIndex\":\"p1\",\"type\":\"search\",\"panelRefName\":\"panel_p1\",\"embeddableConfig\":{}},{\"version\":\"8.14.3\",\"gridData\":{\"y\":20,\"w\":24,\"h\":15,\"i\":\"p2\",\"x\":0},\"panelIndex\":\"p2\",\"type\":\"search\",\"panelRefName\":\"panel_p2\",\"embeddableConfig\":{}},{\"version\":\"8.14.3\",\"gridData\":{\"y\":20,\"w\":24,\"h\":15,\"i\":\"p3\",\"x\":24},\"panelIndex\":\"p3\",\"type\":\"search\",\"panelRefName\":\"panel_p3\",\"embeddableConfig\":{}},{\"version\":\"8.14.3\",\"gridData\":{\"y\":35,\"w\":24,\"h\":12,\"i\":\"p4\",\"x\":0},\"panelIndex\":\"p4\",\"type\":\"search\",\"panelRefName\":\"panel_p4\",\"embeddableConfig\":{}},{\"version\":\"8.1